'W05.Terminal.soc_increment' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
W05.Terminal.charge_cost : ∀ (price wear q len : ℝ), price * (q * len) + wear * (q * len) = (price + wear) * len * q
'W05.Terminal.charge_cost' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
W05.Terminal.no_single_slot_can_be_insufficient : (¬∃ q, 0 ≤ q ∧ q ≤ 1 ∧ q = 2) ∧
