'W05.Terminal.no_single_slot_can_be_insufficient' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
W05.Obstructions.unverified_anchor : 1 > 0 ∧ ∀ t ∈ Set.Icc 0 1, 0 < (1 - t) * 1 + t * 2
