'W05.Obstructions.inverse_can_break_bounds' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
W05.Obstructions.box_gap_over_true_gap : (∀ x ∈ Set.Icc 0 1, x - x = 0) ∧ 1 - 0 = 1
