W05.Obstructions.arbitrarily_small_violation : ∀ (e : ℝ), 0 < e → W05.rowNeed e 0 = 1 ∧ (1 - 1) * 0 + 1 * 1 - 0 = 1
'W05.Obstructions.arbitrarily_small_violation' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
W05.Obstructions.mixture_of_anchors : max (W05.rowNeed 1 1) (W05.rowNeed 1 0) = 1 ∧
